flowchart TB
    FE[Frontend] -->|HTTP /api/v1| Proxy[Reverse proxy]
    Proxy -->|auth, admin, rooms| Identity[Identity Service]
    Proxy -->|issues, categories| Issues[Issues Service + Publisher]
    Identity --> IDB[(identity_db)]
    Issues --> ISDB[(issues_db)]
    Issues -->|Internal HTTP: housing| Identity
    Issues -.->|Events| MQ[RabbitMQ]
    MQ -.-> N[Notification Service]
    N --> NDB[(notifications_db)]
    N -->|sendMessage| TG[Telegram group]
